<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan weekly forex reserves rise to $1.485 bln.</title>
<headline>Pakistan weekly forex reserves rise to $1.485 bln.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the weekly foreign exchange reserves holdings position in Pakistan:</p>
<p>    (bln dollars)		Jan 9	Jan 2    Jan 11, 1996</p>
<p>TOTAL			   1.485	1.461    2.407</p>
<p>Forex in Pakistan	   0.409	0.409    1.356</p>
<p>Forex outside Pakistan    0.387	0.363    0.329</p>
<p>Gold coins and bullion    0.676	0.676    0.707</p>
<p>Special Drawing Rights    0.013	0.013    0.015</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
